  Fast Optimized GCC
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

This set of packages are original GCC's packages replaced with local tuning and
more aggressive optimizations.

This project is forked from the original PKGBUILD from official archlinux's repo.

 1. ISSUES
-----------
URL: https://sr.ht/~devlavender/arch-aur-contribs/

Please report bugs and improvement suggestions there.

 2. CONTRIBUTING
-----------------

Contributions should be sent using standard patch emailing format (i.e. via
`git send-email`) to ~devlavender/arch-aur-contribs@lists.sr.ht
